  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds an asynchronous API alongside the existing synchronous one. Nothing is removed or changed:\n      IAuthService and IEntityRepository<T> keep their exact shape and behaviour.\n\n      New: IAuthServiceAsync (login path: GetUserDynamicByValuesAsync, GetUserByIdAsync, GetClaimsAsync,\n      CreateAccessTokenAsync, RegisterExtendedUserAsync, GetUserDynamicByIdAsync) and\n      IEntityRepositoryAsync<T>. AuthManager and EfEntityRepositoryBase<T> implement both contracts.\n\n      The asynchronous members open a short-lived DbContext per call rather than sharing the long-lived one,\n      so concurrent logins no longer contend on a single context. GetClaimsAsync also resolves claims in two\n      queries instead of one per claim.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "verbatimVersion": "1.1.9",
